Z||000011||Greg Piet||08-31-2000||04:53 PM||||Well my majority of cars I am competing with are the hamsters (Rx-7 rotary's), Miata's, 280 Z's, and MR-2's.  I have gone up a shelby turbo 2.2 litre a few times, but that was early on so I wasn't doing very well yet.<P>Hopefully My Fiero will get a nice big trophy at the end of the season, so I can take pics with the trophy to draw the eye away from the needed paint job.<P>And yes 80's Boy those DAMN MIATA'S!!!!!<P>The 4 banger is in another class, and I am not sure how it would do.  I will likey get flamed for this, but the NORMAL 4-bangers always seemed like gutless wonders whenever I drove them.  I know some of you love your Iron Ducks, and more power to you(that leaves more v6 parts out there for me so I am not complaining)!||||reg||1
